   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SFRV/LWF Sanski Most 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;verordnade m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att f&#xE5; den lokala ursprungsbefolkningen tillbaks till lokalsamh&#xE4;llen och att &#xE5;teruppr&#xE4;tta basfunktioner och element&#xE4;ra f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningar till f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjning i dessa samh&#xE4;llen. M&#xE5;l- grupper &#xE4;r &#xE5;tervandrande minoriteter, lokala internflyktingar och &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndande flyktingar fr&#xE5;n Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is the return of 136 families to their homes and the rehabilitation of war-damaged local communities. The target group consists in both &quot;majorities&quot; of IDPs and refugees returning to homes within the Federation and of mutually retuning minorities between Sanski Most (Fed) and Prijedor (RS).</narrative>
  </description>
